{"id":"ea2f0556099a403a","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-partial-truth-definition.md","title":"Partial Truth Definition","display":"df-partial-truth-definition — Partial Truth Definition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-partial-truth-definition","aliases":["67-df-partial-truth-definition"],"display":"df-partial-truth-definition — Partial Truth Definition","depends_on":["[[67-df-sentence]]","[[67-df-prim-provability]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_chapter":1,"source_label":"partial truth-definition; Fact 10","source_printed_pages":18,"source_pdf_pages":29,"source_proof_status":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-partial-truth-definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-partial-truth-definition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-truth-definition — Partial Truth Definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"source_label","html":"partial truth-definition; Fact 10"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"18"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"29"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是固定公式类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(v)\">\\(\\tau(v)\\)</span> 为一元算术公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 为自然 Gödel 编号。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>句子及可推导性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialTruth}_{T,\\Gamma}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialTruth}_{T,\\Gamma}\\)</span> 是下式定义的逐句可证双条件谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialTruth}_{T,\\Gamma}(\\tau)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\tau(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PartialTruth}_{T,\\Gamma}(\\tau)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\tau(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 p.18 的 partial truth-definition 是逐句可证双条件；与外部真句集合 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cb812f5c5aa42196\" href=\"?note=cb812f5c5aa42196\" title=\"67-df-truth-predicate\">67-df-truth-predicate</a> 不同。Fact 10 的存在性是原书列为未证明的基础事实，本条只定义接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"句子及可推导性见 [[67-df-sentence]]、[[67-df-prim-provability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"句子及可推导性见 [[67-df-sentence]]、[[67-df-prim-provability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"cb812f5c5aa42196","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 p.18 的 partial truth-definition 是逐句可证双条件；与外部真句集合 [[67-df-truth-predicate]] 不同。Fact 10 的存在性是原书列为未证明的基础事实，本条只定义接口。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(v)","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialTruth}_{T,\\Gamma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialTruth}_{T,\\Gamma}(\\tau)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\tau(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1456,"backlinks":[{"id":"0e6c8c75d056b765","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4837cec0530b35f0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9a6819cbf817140e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialTruth}_{U,\\Gamma}$ 见 [[67-df-partial-truth-definition]]，$\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}$ 为至多自由变量 $v$ 的公式集合；取自然编号并使用 [[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-partial-truth-definition]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-partial-truth-definition]]"}],"outgoing":["854772391cef4007","573b4c635ea6d91f","cb812f5c5aa42196"]}